{"id":"wb-6-755","name":"金龙桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"金龙桥","text":"金龙桥，又名梓里江桥、梓里桥，是云南省丽江市境内金沙江上的一座铁链索道桥，位于古城区七河镇羊见村与永胜县大安乡梓里村之间，距丽江古城约80千米，距永胜县城150余千米。始建于清光绪二年（1876年），民国二十五年（1936年）重修，2009年至2016年完成原址抬高复原重建。是中国现存桥面最宽、铁索最多的铁链桥，也是金沙江上现存最古老的铁链桥。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E9%BE%99%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":94618955,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94618955","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/97a28753c689eeee435c7330.jpg","title":"金龙桥_2026-06-22_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%87%91%E9%BE%99%E6%A1%A5_2026-06-22_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/%E9%87%91%E9%BE%99%E6%A1%A5_2026-06-22_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​丽江金龙桥","width":320,"height":213}}